WEBVTT

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:04.330
I finally found you, you grinning jerk!

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:06.720
Sora Shiunin, what are you doing here?

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:10.120
Edo, I heard you'd joined Yuya's side.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:12.960
I don't normally expect such 
good judgment from you.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:16.020
So this is the traitorous commander

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:18.700
and, um... who were you, again?

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.530
Damn you! Don't act like you don't know me!

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:26.110
I still haven't forgotten how 
you stole Rin and ran off!

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:28.270
Yeah, yeah. I hear you.

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:30.580
You can never tone it down, huh?

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:34.810
Currently, I'm a little busy. 
Can we work this out later?

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:36.000
Like hell!

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.380
You're gonna duel me right now!

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:42.650
Hey, what about Rin? We need to 
find the one controlling her.

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:44.200
You take care of her!

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:45.060
What?

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:49.200
Until I beat this guy down, I won't 
be able to think of anything else.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:50.760
You handle the bug guy.

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:52.010
Go, quickly!

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:52.960
Got it!

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:55.110
You'd better win. For Rin's sake, too!

00:00:55.970 --> 00:00:59.260
If you insist, I suppose I have no choice...

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:01.940
Fine, I'll play with you.

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:06.280
All my wins today have felt so unsatisfying.

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:08.410
Maybe it's due to the honor student deck.

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:14.080
I guess I'll have to use my own deck to see.

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:16.740
I used it against you before, after all.

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:18.390
Right, Yugo?

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:20.970
It's not "Yugo"! It's "Hugo"!

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:22.490
At least remember that!

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:26.120
Two men who look like Yuya, again...

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:36.280
Dad!

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:40.750
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:44.420
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:48.320
Their dragons call to each other,

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:51.540
almost as if seeking one another.

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:29.990
The Day the Devil Was Born

00:03:33.890 --> 00:03:36.700
It's been some time, Leo Akaba.

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:38.400
"Some time"?

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.900
Dad, you know Leo Akaba?

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:43.510
Leo... Akaba?

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.640
Stay back, Layra.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:48.180
Layra?

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:51.980
Leo...

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:56.550
Why must a genius like you 
do something so foolish?

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:59.250
Foolish?

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:03.020
Using the pretense of creating an ideal world

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:05.660
to try to conquer the four dimensions!

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:07.260
Dad!

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:11.380
You were a genius who could 
create matter from nothing.

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:16.230
You even created this Real Solid 
Vision from nothing, too.

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:20.240
Without "Solid Vision with mass,"

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:26.210
Action Duels would have never been born, 
nor would my entertainment duels.

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:31.180
Yes, the day I met you changed 
the course of my destiny!

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:43.370
Amazing. I can really touch it.

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:45.260
This is Solid Vision?

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:49.800
So, would you like to use this in your duels?

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:56.510
From that day, we worked together to 
develop the Real Solid Vision system.

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:59.080
And at last, we got it to the point

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:02.700
at which duelists could ride their 
monsters around the field.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:09.280
Leo, you are Real Solid Vision's creator

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:13.160
the one who brought the entertainment 
duelist Yusyo Sakaki into the world.

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:17.700
I'm so grateful that I got to meet you.

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:21.220
Dad and Leo Akaba did that?

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:24.100
Let me ask once more.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:26.240
Why, Leo?

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:28.830
Why would a genius like you

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:31.700
want to do something as foolish 
as invading other dimensions—

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:33.920
I am no genius.

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:38.550
Real Solid Vision was merely existing 
technology that I recreated.

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:40.340
Existing technology?

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:42.320
But you created—

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:44.010
It already existed

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:46.990
in the far more advanced united world.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:48.960
The united world?

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:53.670
The united... world?

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:55.980
Have you never wondered?

00:05:57.080 --> 00:06:01.640
About the reason the four dimensions 
have different summoning methods.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:06.660
The united world used to have all four.

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:11.610
The united world...

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:18.060
Real Solid Vision already existed there.

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:22.490
But it was still in its earliest stages,

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:28.540
used to decorate houses and 
for corporate advertising.

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:35.260
I wanted to bring Real Solid Vision 
into a new world of potential.

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:42.490
I wanted to create a more flexible, 
lively, and lifelike Solid Vision,

00:06:42.490 --> 00:06:44.250
and shock the world.

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:47.990
With that ambition, I set my sights on

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:55.130
the card game that had long excited the 
people of the world, Duel Monsters!

00:06:55.130 --> 00:06:58.960
I wanted to render its monsters 
in Real Solid Vision.

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:05.070
Originally, Solid Vision technology had 
developed alongside Duel Monsters.

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:08.410
Adapting Real Solid Vision to Duel Monsters,

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:12.880
developed alongside the original system, 
felt like a return to first principles.

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:18.980
I dreamed of developing a working 
technology and achieving world fame.

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:24.960
But I didn't realize that I was 
about to open Pandora's box.

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:31.630
Real Solid Vision's compatibility 
with Duel Monsters was perfect.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:35.210
It produced a more lifelike Real Solid Vision,

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:40.380
exactly like living beings, down to 
each individual strand of hair!

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:43.640
During my research,

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:46.430
I realized that monsters created 
with Real Solid Vision,

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:49.780
had actual body heat, however weak,

00:07:50.310 --> 00:07:55.490
and were capable of faintly 
reacting to external stimuli.

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:59.750
"Duel Monsters cards have souls."

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:02.280
That old wives' tale nagged at me,

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:07.080
but in the history of Duel Monsters, 
there had been no data on this idea,

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:08.770
so I dismissed it.

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:17.110
At last, I completed my research.

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:21.410
And the powerful duels, 
between monsters with real mass,

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:29.320
invigorated the people more than ever.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:33.360
As the man who had brought 
a new era to dueling,

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:35.740
I was celebrated by the world.

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:43.230
However, that technology would 
also bring the world to ruin.

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:44.470
Ruin?

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:46.970
Yes.

00:08:46.970 --> 00:08:50.740
That excitement is what started 
us on a road to destruction.

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:53.980
With that man's appearance.

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:59.580
At first, that duelist was like any other.

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:02.200
But mysteriously, he kept winning...

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:08.390
He said, "I can hear the voices of the monsters."

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:10.430
And it seemed true.

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:13.960
It was as if he were communicating with them,

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:17.800
as he ran, jumped, and raced around the field.

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:22.310
But then, in a fight, things escalated.

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:29.350
He harmed his opponent badly.

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:33.180
The audience was shocked, but...

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.520
Bravo!

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:48.300
Audiences encouraged him to fight

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:51.530
rougher, more exciting duels.

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:53.400
And to meet their desires,

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:58.060
he began giving rougher, showier performances.

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:02.040
That inflamed the audiences even more,

00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:05.780
and other duelists began to imitate him.

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:10.090
Duels escalated in ferocity, 
with no end in sight.

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:14.290
Amidst that environment,

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:19.800
demonstrating speed, power, and performance 
that outstripped his rivals,

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:21.230
he kept winning.

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:26.200
And all at once, he'd become the 
superstar of the duel world.

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:28.370
That man's name was...

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.310
Z-ARC.

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:32.940
Z-ARC?

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:36.960
Z-ARC continued to meet the demands of

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:39.780
the fans who wanted more realistic fights.

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:44.760
He continued to evolve, to further 
shock and delight his audience.

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:49.180
He even came to control the strongest dragons

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:53.500
of each summoning method: 
Fusion, Synchro, and Xyz.

00:10:57.350 --> 00:10:58.180
Duel!

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:01.280
I'll take the first turn.

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:04.190
When no cards are on my side of the field,

00:11:04.190 --> 00:11:06.090
I can activate my spell card Speedraw.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:09.650
Its effect lets me draw two cards

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:13.850
and send one Speedroid from 
my hand to the graveyard.

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:17.630
Then, I summon Speedroid Double Yoyo.

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:22.060
Its effect lets me Special Summon Speedroid 
Tri-Eyed Dice from my hand!

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:24.000
Okay, let's go!

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:28.530
Level 3 Tri-Eyed Dice tunes 
Level 4 Double Yoyo!

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:31.920
Flap your beautiful and heroic wings,

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.970
to strike the enemy at the speed of light!

00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:35.440
Synchro Summon!

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:40.850
Appear, Level 7 Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:11:47.440 --> 00:11:50.090
I set three cards and end my turn.

00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:54.120
I wonder what this feeling is.

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:56.380
The moment I saw your dragon,

00:11:56.380 --> 00:12:01.870
I felt the need, growing stronger and 
stronger within me, to crush others...

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:04.370
So strong that I can't stop it!

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:05.830
My turn!

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:10.860
I activate my spell card 
Polymerization from my hand,

00:12:10.860 --> 00:12:17.380
and I fuse Predaplant Flytrap and 
Predaplant Moray Nepenthes!

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:21.450
Two beautiful flowers, which use alluring 
fragrance to attract insects.

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:23.070
Now become one,

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:27.860
and from the hell of your 
petals, birth a new terror.

00:12:27.860 --> 00:12:30.060
Fusion Summon!

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:33.960
Appear, poisonous dragon with hungry fangs,

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:39.160
Level 8 Starving Venom Fusion Dragon!

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:46.210
What's wrong, Layra?

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:49.910
Anger... So much anger...

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:55.370
To survive on the battlefield, Layra attuned 
himself to the minds of others.

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:58.020
If he thinks something is wrong...

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:26.410
Syun! Syun!

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:27.720
Speak to me, Syun!

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:29.770
What's wrong? What happened?

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:36.430
A man named the Doctor is controlling Ruri...

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:38.990
I heard. That's why I'm here.

00:13:38.990 --> 00:13:40.960
Kaito! Kurosaki?

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:42.330
Are you all right?

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:45.270
I've located the Doctor who's controlling Ruri.

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:47.900
Yeah, I heard about it, too.

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:49.740
He's down this hall, right?

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:54.210
Kurosaki, the fact that you're 
here suggests that Ruri...

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:58.080
Yeah, Yuya ran after the 
possessed Ruri and Serena.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:59.680
You two, join them, quickly.

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:01.130
Yuya?

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:02.060
Let's hurry.

00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:04.730
Syun, we're heading on ahead!

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:23.040
Z-ARC, who could use all the summoning 
methods and control monsters at will,

00:14:23.490 --> 00:14:29.190
took all the world's titles and soon stood 
at the summit of the duel world.

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:33.120
And then, the day arrived...

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:35.950
Z-ARC! Z-ARC! Z-ARC!

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:38.050
Is this the end?

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:40.420
Is there no one left to fight me?

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:42.890
I'm not yet satisfied.

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:46.600
I want to grow stronger... I want 
to fight more fiercely!

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:50.940
We aren't satisfied, either!

00:14:50.940 --> 00:14:54.040
Show us more amazing duels, Z-ARC!

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:57.920
More! More! More! More!

00:14:57.920 --> 00:14:59.020
I like it!

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:02.050
Your words become power for my monsters.

00:15:02.050 --> 00:15:06.520
Your wishes make us strong.

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:09.490
Strong enough to destroy the world!

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:11.560
Destroy the world?

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:13.420
Yes.

00:15:13.420 --> 00:15:17.770
We'll keep fighting, just as you wish!

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:43.240
The ceaseless greed of the people, 
wishing to see harder, more exciting duels,

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:45.590
gave birth to the devil named "Z-ARC."

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:52.140
And Z-ARC projected that growing 
violence on his monsters

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:55.770
and gave them their own urge to destroy.

00:15:56.230 --> 00:15:59.790
No... By then, the monsters

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:02.940
were no longer subject to his will alone.

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:06.490
They're angry.

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:11.560
The monsters are taking their anger out on us!

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:16.430
That's when the old words I once heard

00:16:16.430 --> 00:16:19.120
surfaced once more in my mind.

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:25.110
"Duel Monsters cards have souls."

00:16:27.470 --> 00:16:32.170
That old wives' tale I'd dismissed 
in favor of science,

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:35.660
appeared before me again, 
in the worst possible way.

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:40.110
By giving monsters real bodies,

00:16:40.110 --> 00:16:43.340
their anger could also physically manifest.

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:47.930
The monsters given bodies 
through Real Solid Vision

00:16:47.930 --> 00:16:50.760
far outstripped conventional weaponry.

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:58.020
The monsters, having been made to 
satisfy the people's greed by fighting,

00:16:58.020 --> 00:17:00.430
had begun taking their revenge.

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:10.790
I see!

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:13.010
You aren't satisfied yet?

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:15.010
Neither am I.

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:17.760
I will become one with you, mind and body,

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:19.980
and achieve ultimate power!

00:17:19.980 --> 00:17:22.900
Now, we'll become one!

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:25.690
Yuya!

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:28.890
What's wrong, Yuya? Are you okay?

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:33.160
Astrograph Sorcerer, who controls spacetime...

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:43.510
Use your unfathomable power to unite our wishes!

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:48.780
Now...

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:50.410
...make us one.

00:17:50.930 --> 00:17:51.900
Yuya?

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:54.620
He's acting strange. What's going on?

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:57.960
Make us...

00:17:57.960 --> 00:17:59.190
...one.

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:12.970
I've been waiting for... this moment.

00:18:13.890 --> 00:18:15.310
We will...

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:16.810
...become one!

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:21.050
It's just like that time...

00:18:23.730 --> 00:18:24.960
We'll become one.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:26.280
We'll become one.

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:34.390
What's going on?

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:40.260
Now, we'll become one!

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:47.770
Th-This is...

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:17.290
No... It can't be.

00:19:33.840 --> 00:19:38.680
The four dragons and Z-ARC... 
They became one?

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:45.910
At last, I have it.

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:49.610
I've become one with the four ultimate dragons

00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:52.100
and attained the power of a god.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:54.070
The power of a god?

00:19:54.570 --> 00:19:56.080
Yes...

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:59.690
The four strongest dragons

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:06.010
of Standard, Fusion, Synchro, and Xyz 
summoning methods joined together,

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:11.240
absorbing their duelist, to create 
the ultimate monster.

00:20:11.240 --> 00:20:14.890
People called it "Supreme King Z-ARC"!

00:20:16.890 --> 00:20:21.260
No!

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:28.290
I'm grateful to all of you.

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:33.610
The greed of you humans, 
desiring combat and loving battle,

00:20:33.610 --> 00:20:36.480
has bestowed ultimate power upon me.

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:48.390
Supreme King Z-ARC, combining the power 
of monsters and duelist in one body,

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:50.470
was a vision out of nightmares.

00:20:53.860 --> 00:20:59.070
The only ones who could oppose it were 
duelists who had the same power.

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:03.240
As you wished,

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:07.940
I have become the embodiment 
of stronger, greater power!

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:24.060
It was believed that nothing could destroy

00:21:24.060 --> 00:21:26.900
that Supreme King, with a god's power.

00:21:27.940 --> 00:21:30.540
But I could not give up.

00:21:30.980 --> 00:21:35.140
I felt a responsibility for creating that devil.

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:41.380
I had to save the world, even if it cost me my life.

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:44.940
Stop... Stop it! Please!

00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:48.220
Calm down, Layra. He's just making it up!

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:51.690
No! I am not making it up!

00:21:53.420 --> 00:21:56.660
I saw it all.

00:21:56.660 --> 00:21:58.620
It was real.

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:06.100
The world was to end soon

00:22:07.110 --> 00:22:10.360
at the hands of Supreme King Z-ARC!

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:53.040
Supreme King Z-ARC, created when 
the world was united...

00:23:53.480 --> 00:23:56.080
Its power was so immense,

00:23:56.080 --> 00:23:59.550
humanity's conventional weapons 
didn't stand a chance.

00:23:59.550 --> 00:24:03.630
To stop it, the Professor created four cards

00:24:03.630 --> 00:24:05.950
that harnessed the power of nature.

00:24:05.950 --> 00:24:06.860
But...

00:24:06.860 --> 00:24:10.150
I don't want to lose you, Father!

00:24:10.980 --> 00:24:14.870
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Revival Zero.

00:24:14.870 --> 00:24:16.950
The fun is only getting started!
